---
/* layouts/CollectionIndexTemplate - WF-05. Catalog index for the evidence
   families (projects, research, creative; the publications/books/talks/
   downloads indexes project onto it). Semantic composition only: the
   route fills the named slots with accepted components - Breadcrumbs,
   SectionLead as="h1" opener, the no-JS filter seam (URL-backed filter
   controls), ContentRow / MediaTile results or an honest ContentState
   empty/no-results panel, and pagination. Required regions render
   unconditionally; this template has no optional regions, so there is
   no wrapper gap to guard. Header and footer landmarks are owned by
   BaseLayout. No data fetching, no CMS calls, no route policy.
   Seams: a new catalog family reuses this template as-is through its
   route adapter; row/grid shape changes belong to the content
   components. Theming cascades from tokens. */
---
<div class="tpl-collection">
  <div class="tpl-collection__breadcrumbs"><slot name="breadcrumbs" /></div>
  <div class="tpl-collection__lead"><slot name="sectionLead" /></div>
  <div class="tpl-collection__filters"><slot name="filters" /></div>
  <div class="tpl-collection__results"><slot name="results" /></div>
  <div class="tpl-collection__pagination"><slot name="pagination" /></div>
</div>

<style>
  .tpl-collection {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    max-width: var(--measure-page);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: var(--space-gutter);
    padding-block: var(--space-section);
  }
</style>
